                "text": "**Analyzing Grid Transformations**\n\nI'm currently dissecting grid transformations, focusing on the fractal-like expansion from 3x3 to larger sizes. I've started by examining specific examples. I've inverted the colors in an input grid to see if that reveals patterns, and I'm looking for relevant patterns between the input and the potential output.\n\n\n",
